This project is an independent, unofficial tool. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or sponsored by ByteDance, CapCut, or Lemon Inc.

It reads and writes CapCut's local project files (`draft_info.json` and related
mirrors) on the machine where CapCut is installed. CapCut, its effects, fonts,
sounds, and project format are the property of their respective owners.

Shipped presets contain *lookup keys* (effect names, resource IDs, cache path
patterns) captured from real CapCut projects so the tool can clone verified
native structures instead of inventing them. They are not CapCut binaries, not
a redistribution of CapCut's effect packages, and they will not resolve until
you download the corresponding effects inside CapCut on your own Mac.

Third-party brand names and logo *paths* in `presets/brands.json` are examples
for the signature pass. Do not commit logo raster files you do not own.

Use of this software with CapCut is subject to CapCut's own terms of service.
The authors provide no warranty that writing project JSON is permitted on your
account or in your jurisdiction.
